  "content": "\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_rights_reserved\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/assets%20license-All%20Rights%20Reserved-red.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"資產授權（保留所有權利）\"></a>\n  \n  <a href=\"https://github.com/KreloX/Gloves-For-All/blob/1.20.1/LICENSE.txt\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code%20license-LGPL%20v3.0-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"程式碼授權（LGPL v3.0）\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n  <a href='https://moddex.gg/mod/aether-gloves-for-all'><img src='https://moddex.gg/badges/projects/aether-gloves-for-all/rating.svg?style=devin' alt='ModDex 評分'>\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n<h2><center>🥊 關於此附加模組 🥊</center></h2>\n  \n<p>\n  Gloves For All 附加模組針對其他模組的特定材質新增了手套版本。手套的製作或取得方式與對應的其他護甲部件相同。目前，任何完整套裝的特殊能力都需裝備手套才能觸發（若未在《The Aether》伺服器設定中停用則適用）。\n</p>\n\n<p>\n  如需《The Aether》與《Twilight Forest》的相容性，請安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/umbral-skies\">Umbral Skies</a>\n</p>\n\n<h3>支援以下模組：</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/caverns-and-chasms\">Caverns & Chasms</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/savage-and-ravage\">Savage & Ravage</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/galosphere\">Galosphere</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/addadd\">Additional Additions</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/simpleores\">SimpleOres</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-undergarden\">The Undergarden</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/blue-skies\">Blue Skies</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voidscape\">Voidscape</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-midnight\">The Midnight</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deeperdarker\">Deeper and Darker</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/botania\">Botania</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/create\">Create</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/redstone-arsenal\">Redstone Arsenal</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tools-complement\">Tool's Complement</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/thermal-cultivation\">Thermal Cultivation</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/thermal-innovation\">Thermal Innovation</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/thermal-extra\">Thermal Extra</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mekanism-tools\">Mekanism Tools</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ice-and-fire-dragons\">Ice and Fire</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a37bc7ff0ce5bc39482171cc41d9c1825b7ad76e.png\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n<h2><center>☁️ 作者聲明 ☁️</center></h2>\n\n<p>\n  Gloves For All 是由 KreloX 開發的非官方附加模組，未獲得 The Aether Team 的參與或授權。\n</p>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/kreloxkinetic\">\n    <img src=\"https://1drv.ms/i/c/6bf544900f9867ae/IQR3yxNMtle9S4RxniPeeGgMAVrcnQ4U65DGA1uiSdBUIbE?width=837&height=80\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\" />\n  </a>\n</center>",
